### 3. Update budget

`BenchmarkUpdate` on a 400-vertex, ~2,000-edge random connected CFG (AMD Ryzen 7 7840HS):

```
BenchmarkUpdate-16   200   994521 ns/op   # one insert + one delete, ~1 ms each
```

Each update performs exactly one reachability pass plus one dominator rebuild; cost is bounded by the current graph size and independent of update-history length.

